# Experiment configs: the hand-written sweep configs are committed (allowlisted
# below); everything else in experiments/ is a generated/throwaway run config
# (per-shard sweeps, mini/validate runs) and is ignored. To commit a NEW
# hand-written config, add a matching `!` exception line here.
scaffold/experiments/*.toml
!scaffold/experiments/fuzzing-baseline.toml
!scaffold/experiments/fuzzing-test.toml
!scaffold/experiments/patching-model-sweep.toml
!scaffold/experiments/triage-sweep.toml
